        "official_en_sha256": "8cd519e3d46723c934ff3a2b82e53244f97164da9e9af74b4d0ef7ff8c883b57"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺たちも出し惜しみするな！\r\n全ての力を王土にぶつけるんだ！",
        "official_en": "Then we won’t hold back, either. Let’s give him everything we’ve got!",
        "real_en": null
