      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "鎧の力を限界まで引き出したみたいね。\r\nでも、それをやったら劫火のように……。",
        "official_en": "He’s drawn out the last of his armor’s power. In doing so, he’s resigned himself to the same fate as Ignis...",
        "real_en": "It looks like he's drawn his armor's power to its limit. But if he does that, he'll end up like Inferno Veritas..."
